<p><code>pop-utils</code> is the grab bag the rest of the framework is built on: static helpers for strings, arrays and
numbers, the collection type every multi-row query hands back, array objects, dates, UUIDs and file
metadata, and the callable wrapper behind the service locator and the event manager.</p>
